 UPDATE progress; WD_O: full-I/O progress. SET1=0 disables its timer. MR open per frozen IS-1."(at 15.24 51.0 0)(effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))(uuid "4894f1a9-e0f3-565a-ab0e-2234526d9fa4"))(text "WDI: one 1us high pulse, idle LOW. FALLING edges feed timer.\nOld toggle-per-UPDATE gateware is INCOMPATIBLE.\n3.3nF C0G: calculated timing, never a measured20ms proof."(at 292.1 53.34 0)(effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))(uuid "2d3b8d89-ccaa-5434-83da-d44f356a6548"))(text "Each RESET + WDO wired-AND with\n10k pull-up. WD_M_OK / WD_O_OK\nhave100k pulls; partial power UNQUALIFIED.\nNo sticky permission latch in this block."(at 432.0 121.0 0)(effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))(uuid "2bd5c459-79e5-5245-a7db-9ecfd7bcc3e1"))(text "T20 reset GPIO weak pull-ups defeat100k\nrequest/progress pulls (about2.73V worst\ncase). Startup LOW is NOT qualified.\nNeeds reviewed interface conditioning;\nfuture permission gates are not drawn."(at 432.0 277.0 0)(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top))(uuid "d6dd6336-8d8c-544f-a4a2-2af5367c8e6e"))(text "DRB copper-pad candidate only: paste/stencil, thermal vias, CWD guarding/cleanliness/leakage, routing, partial power and brownout remain unqualified."(at 15.24 397.51 0)(effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top))(uuid "75a415f1-8c45-58c3-af4d-fc52618bb4c7")))
